      "message": "Suppose I want to send 1MiB. The effect of this loop is that I send it 512 bytes at a time, copying each chunk into the buffer - but it would be better to just make a single call to wait_for_send.\n\nSo I suggest you have 3 options:\n- data is bigger than WRITE_BUF_CAPACITY: flush(), then write all of data.\n- data fits in buffer: just append it to the buffer\n- data doesn\u0027t currently fit in buffer: exactly what you have here.",
